# Optional. Default in code is already:
#   /light-pollution/viirs-vnl-2024-500m.cog.tif
# Local: place the COG under public/light-pollution/ (gitignored).
# Prod (OVH): Caddy serves the same URL from a persistent data dir — no override needed.
# Allowed values: same-origin path (/…), or https:// on *.sadr3d.com / localhost.
# Arbitrary third-party hosts are ignored at runtime (see cogConfig.ts).
# VITE_LIGHT_POLLUTION_COG_URL=/light-pollution/viirs-vnl-2024-500m.cog.tif

# Legacy coarse GIBS bake only (not for zenith Bortle):
# VITE_LIGHT_POLLUTION_COG_IS_EOG=legacy-gibs

# Open-Meteo overrides (optional):
# VITE_OPEN_METEO_FORECAST_URL=
# VITE_OPEN_METEO_ARCHIVE_URL=

# First-party Umami (optional). Without WEBSITE_ID the tracker stays off.
# Prod: set these in .env.production on the VPS (see docs/UMAMI.md).
# VITE_UMAMI_SCRIPT_URL=https://analytics.sadr3d.com/script.js
# VITE_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=
